sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant Redis

    Client->>API: Request /endpoint
    API->>Redis: INCR rate:ip:1.2.3.4
    Redis->>API: First request (1)
    API->>Redis: EXPIRE rate:ip:1.2.3.4 60
    API->>Client: 200 OK

    Client->>API: Request /endpoint
    API->>Redis: INCR rate:ip:1.2.3.4
    Redis->>API: Second request (2)
    API->>Client: 200 OK

    Client->>API: Request /endpoint (too many)
    API->>Redis: INCR rate:ip:1.2.3.4
    Redis->>API: Over limit (6)
    API->>Client: 429 Too Many Requests